{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1406102-wanna-play-a-solar-crafter-dislike-the-charmset-good-news","id":1406102,"title":"Wanna play a solar crafter? Dislike the charmset? Good news!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-03T06:47:49-07:00","id":1406102,"title":"Wanna play a solar crafter? Dislike the charmset? Good news!","content":"So did I.<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nVsmW60zfBYNdEjnlfd8NcPubx56gZXEzzedZRCrhoo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">So I just made a new craft charmset from scratch.</a><br /> <br /> It still uses the default craft system as-is, as I feel it is good on the lower end and adequate on the higher end.<br /> I had 3 major goals in mind:<br /> 1) crafting artifacts is a huge deal and its own thing, and so crafters not interested in artifacts should get more love.<br /> 2) minimize convolution. You won't see 5 charms that are numerical expansions on the same thing all the time. You want oodles of xp? that's 4 charms already including &quot;buy dots with craft xp&quot; and &quot;transform craft xp&quot;.<br /> 3) encourage different playstyles and ways to mix crafting with the rest of the game. Solar crafters are miracle workers even before they touch their first magical material.<br /> <br /> I balanced the roll boosters around &quot;you want to use progressively more of them as you craft bigger stuff&quot; and tried to keep the conservative odds at &quot;if you don't push for external aides like exceptional tools and stunts you will be taking a sensible risk of failure&quot;. I also tried to keep the math simple (the most complex it gets is the capstone doubling accrued successes at the expense of craft xp) and unconditional.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":32,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","user":"Synapse","date":". 08-03-2020, 09:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T07:20:26-07:00","id":1406109,"title":"","content":"Looks good. 2 questions :<br /> <br /> -The 1st Charm (<b>Flawless Handiwork Method</b>) has the keyword &quot;Stackable&quot; but its benefits are dice tricks which can't really stack. Is the Stackable tag in error or is something else going on I'm not seeing?<br /> <br /> -<b>Anointed Relics of Light</b> : sidebar says it <i>also</i> works against creatures of darkness. But what is the normal target when not being used against creatures of darkness? &quot;the wicked that would strive to destroy their world&quot; is vague to the point I thought it was just flavor text and that the Charm applied to any enemy before I read the sidebar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25285,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","user":"Epitome","date":". 08-03-2020, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T07:32:38-07:00","id":1406111,"title":"","content":"Each activation of FHM gives you one of the two benefits. So you have to use it twice on the same task to get both the doubler and the reroll.<br /> <br /> The sidebar on Anointed Relics is mostly a commentary on how Creatures of Darkness is a bit ill-defined. It guaranteedly works on fae,dead,demons, and will work on whatever else the st deems a CoD.<br /> I will make it clearer according to how I feel this effect is understood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T08:19:28-07:00","id":1406113,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the clarifications! For FHM I'd suggest mentioning explicitly in the description that each activation grants 1 effect and you must activate it twice to get both effects. As is the Charm description is in the grey area where it's technically correct, but is stated ambiguously enough to be misinterpreted by a portion of players (like I did).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T08:22:08-07:00","id":1406115,"title":"","content":"Will do. Everyone there can leave suggestions as well, if you feel a more precise comment would help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T14:12:41-07:00","id":1406144,"title":"","content":"I like this a lot.<br /> It seems like if you have all the power charms, you still have a ~23% chance of failing to craft an NA artifact. I would be inclined to add another power charm, but it might be you intended 5-dots to never be a sure thing.<br /> Blade Loves Its Makers seems very strong. It has few enough prerequisites to buy as a non-craft character, but you'd still need to make the weapons and choose between making artifacts or using non-artifacts so probably not dippable?<br /> &quot;grant Sobriquet&quot; is an interesting mechanical implementation of &quot;this gear looks really cool&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T14:26:17-07:00","id":1406148,"title":"","content":"This is intended.<br /> <br /> Here's the rough success chances for a legendary project presuming you are going full excellency + all potency charms on every roll, and then adding 2 dice (stunt 1), 3 dice (stunt 1 + exceptional tools), 4 dice (stunt 1 + exceptional tools with whatever shenanigans give you +2).<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">excellency + all power charms</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">43.62%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">excellency + all power charms + stunt 1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"> 77.39%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">excellency + all power charms + stunt 1 + exceptional workshop</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"> 88.19%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">excellency + all power charms + stunt 1 + exceptional workshop++</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"> 94.56%</td> </tr> </table></div> A stunt 2 on the rolls has a similar effect, as does spending wp, although at this point you'll be easily drained 5-8 wp and have to take time off the rolls (which usually isn't important, but it is going to take a couple days more to finish the project).<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> The idea that even a solar has to go that extra mile to secure the greatest undertakings appeals to me, and was one of the better general results I got fiddling with the numbers. Better than non-charm dice charms by a mile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":32,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","user":"Synapse","date":".  Turns out the forum hates html 08-03-2020, 05:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-03T14:30:10-07:00","id":1406149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1406102-wanna-play-a-solar-crafter-dislike-the-charmset-good-news?p=1406148#post1406148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is intended.<br /> <br /> Here's the rough success chances for a legendary project presuming you are going full excellency + all potency charms on every roll, and then adding 2 dice (stunt 1), 3 dice (stunt 1 + exceptional tools), 4 dice (stunt 1 + exceptional tools with whatever shenanigans give you +2).<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> excellency + all power charms 43.62<br /> <br /> excellency + all power charms + stunt 1 77.39<br /> <br /> excellency + all power charms + stunt 1 + exceptional workshop 88.19<br /> <br /> excellency + all power charms + stunt 1 + exceptional workshop++ 94.56<br /> <br /> <br /> A stunt 2 on the rolls has a similar effect, as does spending wp, although at this point you'll be easily drained 5-8 wp and have to take time off the rolls (which usually isn't important, but it is going to take a couple days more to finish the project).<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> The idea that even a solar has to go that extra mile to secure the greatest undertakings appeals to me, and was one of the better general results I got fiddling with the numbers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool.<br /> I think I had forgotten about willpower when finding out this probability (but not my calculations for pre-unbroken image focus so I probably need to redo this to have consistent assumptions).<br /> And had been assuming no exceptional tools, since they're less precisely defined than other inputs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}